<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>ARC 2027 — The 23rd International Symposium on Applied Reconfigurable Computing</title>
<meta name="description" content="ARC 2027 · Berlin, Germany · March 31 – April 2, 2027 · Preliminary Call for Papers">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,400;0,9..144,500;0,9..144,600;0,9..144,700;1,9..144,500&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/style.css">
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <nav class="wrap">
    <div class="brand-lockup">
      <img src="assets/arc_logo.png" alt="">
      ARC<span class="yr">2027</span>
    </div>
    <div class="navlinks" id="navlinks">
      <a href="#cfp">Call for Papers</a>
      <a href="#dates">Dates</a>
      <a href="#topics">Topics</a>
      <a href="#committee">Committee</a>
      <a href="#venue">Venue</a>
      <a href="registration.html" class="navcta">Registration</a>
    </div>
    <button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn" aria-label="Toggle menu"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
  </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="fabric" id="fabric"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <span class="eyebrow">Preliminary Call for Papers</span>
      <h1>The 23rd International Symposium on <em>Applied Reconfigurable Computing</em></h1>
      <div class="hero-meta">
        <span><b>Berlin, Germany</b></span>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>March 31 – April 2, 2027</span>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>Hosted by Humboldt-Universität zu Berlin</span>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-lede">ARC brings together researchers and practitioners of reconfigurable computing with an emphasis on practical applications — from high-level compilation and design-space exploration to fine-grained fabrics and safety-critical systems.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#cfp">Read the Call for Papers</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#dates">Key Dates</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="assets/ARC2027_Preliminary_CFP.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download CFP (PDF)</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="intro">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p>Reconfigurable computing technologies promise substantial performance gains over traditional architectures by customizing, even at runtime, the topology of the underlying architecture to match the needs of a given application. Contemporary configurable architectures allow functional and storage units to be matched in function, bit-width, and control structure to the specific needs of a computation. The flexibility enabled by reconfiguration is also a key technique for overcoming transient failures in emerging device structures.</p>
    <p>ARC 2027 will feature a series of international invited speakers sharing their view on the future of reconfigurable technology.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="dates-strip" id="dates">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Don't miss the window</span>
        <h2>Important Dates</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="dates-grid">
      <div class="date-card">
        <div class="d">25 Oct 2026</div>
        <div class="l">Submission deadline</div>
      </div>
      <div class="date-card">
        <div class="d">7 Dec 2026</div>
        <div class="l">Author notification</div>
      </div>
      <div class="date-card">
        <div class="d">8 Jan 2027</div>
        <div class="l">Camera-ready &amp; author registration</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="cfp">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">What to submit</span>
        <h2>Call for Papers</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cfp-grid" style="grid-template-columns:1fr; max-width:640px;">
      <div>
        <p style="margin:0 0 22px; color:#333; font-size:15.5px;">Authors are invited to submit original contributions in English, including but not limited to the areas of interest listed below. Submissions must be uploaded to the ARC website, identifying the format of the contribution as either:</p>

        <div class="paper-type">
          <h3>Long Papers</h3>
          <p>14 pages maximum. Mainly accomplished results, presented orally.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="paper-type">
          <h3>Short Papers</h3>
          <p>8 pages maximum (or 10, with a 50 EUR/page surcharge). Work in progress or recent developments, presented as a poster.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="fmt-note">
          Papers must follow the Springer-Verlag LNCS format rules, as described at
          <a href="https://link.springer.com/series/558/information-for-authors-and-editors" target="_blank" rel="noopener">link.springer.com/series/558/information-for-authors-and-editors</a>.
        </div>

        <div class="fmt-note">
          Submissions must be fully anonymous, but authors should not hide previous work, instead, they need to make self-references in the third person.
        </div>

        <h3 style="font-size:17px; font-family:'Inter'; font-weight:700; margin-top:34px;">Paper Submission</h3>
        <p style="margin:8px 0 0; font-size:14.5px;"><a href="https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=arc2027" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--brand); font-weight:600;">Submit via EasyChair</a></p>
        <p style="margin:10px 0 0; font-size:14.5px;"><a href="assets/ARC2027_Preliminary_CFP.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--brand); font-weight:600;">Download the Call for Papers (PDF)</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

