        <ul>
          <li>High-level Compilation</li>
          <li>Simulation</li>
          <li>Estimation Techniques</li>
          <li>Design Space Exploration</li>
          <li>Programming Languages &amp; Paradigms</li>
          <li>Run-Time Systems</li>
          <li>Compilation and Synthesis</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="topic-col">
        <h3>Architectures</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Fine-grained and Mixed-grained</li>
          <li>Multi-Processor based</li>
          <li>Embedded Multi-Core</li>
          <li>Reconfigurable Fabrics</li>
          <li>Resilient through Reconfiguration</li>
          <li>System Architectures &amp; Integration</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="topic-col">
        <h3>Applications</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>High-Performance Systems</li>
          <li>Embedded Computing</li>
          <li>Robotics</li>
          <li>Digital Signal Processing</li>
          <li>Safety and Mission Critical Systems</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="topic-col">
        <h3>Critical Issues</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Teaching Reconfigurable Computing</li>
          <li>Surveys and Future Trends</li>
          <li>Benchmarks</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="pub-strip">
  <div class="wrap pub-inner">
