    <p>ARC 2027 proceedings will be published by Springer-Verlag as a Lecture Notes in Computer Science (LNCS) volume, also available via SpringerLink. Selected papers will additionally be invited for a special issue of ACM Transactions on Reconfigurable Technology and Systems (TRETS).</p>
  </div>
